<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Abraham's Blog</title><link>https://blog.inshomepgup.com/</link><description/><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.inshomepgup.com/tags/windows/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>用 KeePass 管 SSH：Windows、Debian/Ubuntu、macOS</title><link>https://blog.inshomepgup.com/p/keepass-ssh/</link><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.inshomepgup.com/p/keepass-ssh/</guid><description>&lt;p>换机器最烦的不是装系统，是 &lt;code>~/.ssh&lt;/code> 要再拷一遍。私钥散落在 U 盘、网盘、旧电脑里，权限一不对 ssh 直接不理你。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>后来把钥匙放进 KeePass 库，主机信息也写在同一份 kdbx 里。库跟着网盘走，Windows、Debian、macOS 各自用客户端把钥匙交给 ssh，不必再复制私钥文件。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>生成钥匙本身还是老办法，见 &lt;a class="link" href="https://blog.inshomepgup.com/p/ssh-key/" >SSH Key 生成、配置与连接&lt;/a>。这篇只讲：&lt;strong>库怎么记，三个系统怎么接到 &lt;code>ssh config&lt;/code>。&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>客户端约定：&lt;/p>
&lt;table>
&lt;thead>
&lt;tr>
&lt;th>系统&lt;/th>
&lt;th>客户端&lt;/th>
&lt;th>钥匙怎么交给 ssh&lt;/th>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;/thead>
&lt;tbody>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>Debian / Ubuntu&lt;/td>
&lt;td>KeePassXC&lt;/td>
&lt;td>注入系统 &lt;code>ssh-agent&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>Windows&lt;/td>
&lt;td>KeePassXC&lt;/td>
&lt;td>注入 Windows OpenSSH Agent（或 Pageant）&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>macOS&lt;/td>
&lt;td>Strongbox（Pro）&lt;/td>
&lt;td>Strongbox 自己当 agent&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;/tbody>
&lt;/table>
&lt;p>同一份 kdbx。KeePassXC 和 Strongbox 都认 KeeAgent 那套约定。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="库里怎么记">库里怎么记
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>两台机经常共用一把钥匙。所以不要「一台主机一条，私钥复制两份」。&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">SSH/
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> Keys/prod-ed25519 ← 私钥 + 公钥，只这一条
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> Hosts/vps-a ← 连谁
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> Hosts/vps-b
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>&lt;strong>钥匙条目&lt;/strong> &lt;code>/SSH/Keys/prod-ed25519&lt;/code>：&lt;/p></description><category>Computer</category><category>KeePass</category><category>SSH</category><category>KeePassXC</category><category>Strongbox</category><category>Windows</category><category>Linux</category><category>macOS</category></item><item><title>WIndows下的亮度调节软件-Twinkle Tray</title><link>https://blog.inshomepgup.com/programming/os/windows/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%8E%A8%E8%8D%90-twinkle-tray-%E4%BA%AE%E5%BA%A6%E8%B0%83%E8%8A%82/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.inshomepgup.com/programming/os/windows/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%8E%A8%E8%8D%90-twinkle-tray-%E4%BA%AE%E5%BA%A6%E8%B0%83%E8%8A%82/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a class="link" href="https://github.com/xanderfrangos/twinkle-tray" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
